			<div class="content" id="post-content-3582390">
									

<p>For a simple concept, this was really well executed.</p>
<p>You knew the Containment Procedures wouldn't be very interesting, so you got them over quick. Within the first footnote, I was hooked; you see &quot;extradimensional space&quot; a lot on this site, and I'm glad you used that footnote, because unlike other uses of that phrase, I actually did a double take at the dimensions.</p>
<p>I started cringing from the second paragraph. This is a compliment, by the way; you were really good at making this concept as weird and surreal as possible. Smaller things like the little moan by the malformed baby hand, the word &quot;slurry&quot; to describe visera, and the weird font choices in the letter really exemplified the creepy feel of this.</p>
<p>Easy +1</p>

